## gView.Pipe runtime state: workflows, executions, encrypted credentials, data protection keys, installed plugins.
## Anchored on purpose: git on Windows ignores case, and a bare "data/" would also hit source folders named "Data".
## Sample workflows live in /samples and are seeded into an empty store on first start.
src/gView.Pipe.Shell/data/
src/gView.Pipe.Shell/plugins/
src/gView.Pipe.Shell/files/
src/gView.Pipe.Shell/scripts/
